OL,3,GNEWSAMan who bit woman and tried to
OL,4,Atorch her bed jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who broke into a woman's home
OL,7,Fbefore biting her, pulling out her hair
OL,8,Fand trying to set fire to her bed while
OL,9,Fshe slept has been jailed for eight
OL,10,Fyears, with a further three years on
OL,11,Flicence.
OL,13,FCurtis Wilson, 31, of St Werburghs,
OL,14,FBristol, admitted intentional
OL,15,Fstrangulation, assault causing actual
OL,16,Fbodily harm, and arson reckless as to
OL,17,Fwhether life was endangered, in
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
