OL,3,GNEWSAMan who bit woman and tried to
OL,4,Atorch her bed jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attack on 7 February left the woman
OL,7,Fwith bruising to her face and neck and
OL,8,Fbite marks. Wilson also tried to set
OL,9,Ffire to items in the house.
OL,11,FIn a statement to the court, the woman
OL,12,Fsays she "struggles to sleep almost
OL,13,Fevery night, with flashbacks keeping me
OL,14,Fawake." Judge Euan Ambrose called
OL,15,FWilson "extremely violent".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
